# MCP wiring is local environment configuration, never repository content.
# .mcp.json carries an env block a server's credentials end up in; mcps/ holds
# checkouts of servers to run, which would vendor their content if committed.
# AGENTS.md documents how to recreate both.
.mcp.json
mcps/

# The working plan for a task in flight. Scratch, never committed; the task record
# under .agents/memory/tasks/ is what outlives it.
.agents/plans/
